    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"gaining market favor for sustainable practices\" sounds a bit optimistic for a shop my size... most of my clients just care about price and turnaround. aren't these mandates basically just a way for big corporations with huge capital to squeeze out smaller competitors who can't afford the upgrades? it feels like they're being forced on us for no reason.",
