    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i'm not sure i follow \"play by the same rules.\" the rules aren't the same when one company has a multi-million dollar compliance department and i'm just one guy trying to keep my lights on. if the \"reality\" is that these rules are just making it harder for small businesses to survive, isn't it actually a failure of the policy? shouldn't the government be prioritizing local jobs over these massive emission targets?",
